@startuml Video Pages Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Video pages — route and media lifecycle

actor "Reader / Admin" as Client
participant VideoPageController as Controller
participant "VideoPage operation service" as Service
database "MySQL\nVideo pages + media rows" as Repository
participant RouteService as Route
participant MediaItemProcessor as Media
participant "AWS S3" as S3

alt Read
  Client -> Controller : authenticated list or public detail
  Controller -> Service : query or id
  Service -> Repository : load page and route
  Service -> Media : load page videos
  Service --> Client : summary page or full DTO
else Admin create or update
  Client -> Controller : multipart POST/PATCH
  Controller -> Service : page + complete video payload
  Service -> Repository : transaction: persist page
  Service -> Route : create/upsert route in transaction
  Service -> Media : diff links/uploads; preserve or replace files
  Media -> S3 : upload/replace/delete owned files
  Service --> Client : VideosPageResponseDto
else Admin delete
  Service -> Media : remove media rows
  Media -> S3 : delete owned objects
  Service -> Route : remove route
  Service -> Repository : remove page
  Service --> Client : 204
end

note over Repository, S3
  Failed writes compensate persisted media and unreferenced uploads.
end note
@enduml
